// ---- Rules ----
// - Variant A for a single object; B for a collection; C for success-only; D for debug.
// - Always CancellationToken ct = default as the last parameter.
// - Method name convention: {Verb}{Resource}Async.
// - Read which error signal the backend fills (config.error_signal) before switching
//   on IError.Code; Message may be the only populated one.
// - Use the error records (UnknownError, TokenExpiredError, InternalServerError) with
//   Result<TData>.Fail. The *ErrorResult records are Result<IError> and do not fit.
//   The validators in ErrorHandling/ need USE_NETWORK + LanguageExt; not available.
// - Register the surface per its lifetime, not per convenience: scene-bound surfaces
//   in the scene's LifetimeScope, auth-only surfaces singleton in LobbyLifeTimeScope.
//   Never re-register a parent-scoped surface in a child scope — it shadows silently.
